# AI DIAL Admin Evaluation Framework Backend - AI Agent Guidelines

## Project Overview

This is a Spring Boot 3.5.11 backend service for the AI DIAL Admin Evaluation Framework, part of the EPAM AI DIAL Admin product ecosystem. It provides REST APIs for managing evaluation test suites and related resources.

## Technology Stack

- **Java**: 25 (LTS)
- **Framework**: Spring Boot 3.5.11
- **Build Tool**: Gradle 8.13
- **Database**: PostgreSQL (JDBC, not JPA)
- **Migrations**: Flyway
- **Security**: Spring Security with OIDC/JWT (multi-issuer support)
- **API Docs**: OpenAPI 3.0 / Springdoc / Swagger UI
- **Logging**: Log4j2 with MDC correlation IDs
- **Testing**: JUnit 5, Testcontainers (PostgreSQL)
- **Code Style**: Google Java Style (Checkstyle)

## Project Structure

